    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "self-care and \"new foundations\" just feel like more noise. it's all just staying busy to ignore the fact that it's hollow. when you're at the bottom of this, everything feels so heavy and unnecessary. like, if the truth was a lie, then every choice i made was a mistake. why would i want to keep making more mistakes in a world that doesn't even make sense? it'd be so much easier to just let it all stop.",
